@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Backend - Flujo de peticion HTTP

actor "Cliente autenticado" as Client
participant "Tomcat / Spring MVC\nserver.port=8088" as Tomcat
participant "CorsConfigurationSource" as Cors
participant "JwtAuthFilter" as JwtFilter
participant "UserDetailsService\nLoadUserForSecurityAdapter" as UserDetails
participant "UserAccessFilter" as AccessFilter
participant "REST Controller" as Controller
participant "Servicio de caso de uso" as Service
participant "Agregado de dominio" as Domain
participant "Adaptador de repositorio" as Repo
database "MySQL" as Db

Client -> Tomcat : peticion HTTP REST\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
Tomcat -> Cors : valida origenes configurados
Cors --> Tomcat : allowed / rejected
Tomcat -> JwtFilter : filter chain
JwtFilter -> UserDetails : carga usuario desde user :: api
UserDetails --> JwtFilter : UserDetails
JwtFilter -> JwtFilter : validate token\nset SecurityContext
JwtFilter -> AccessFilter : continue chain
AccessFilter -> AccessFilter : owner-level access checks\nwhere applicable
AccessFilter -> Controller : route to controller
Controller -> Service : call port/use case
Service -> Domain : aplica invariantes
Service -> Repo : load/save through port
Repo -> Db : Spring Data JPA
Db --> Repo : datos de entidad
Repo --> Service : domain model
Service --> Controller : result DTO source
Controller --> Client : respuesta JSON

note bottom
Evidencia: AuthenticationConfig, JwtAuthFilter, UserAccessFilter,
controladores, servicios, adaptadores de repositorio y application.properties.
Los endpoints publicos /api/user/register, /auth/login y /ws estan marcados como permitAll.
end note

@enduml
